    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diibiga ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula nih bariinyeega uurjiin gil gooneasa Ghweanda, bea gideaba eeguureewaneasa diibiga ASEETA, ak ea gidasiwuurjeewi gil. Ak abeeda ghoah gidamwanalaneasa ng'eanyiida ak ea mwanala niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga aabwariinyi, asi ghamneawa siwooschi diibiga ASEETA; ak ea miighwadaajiit gichea eewuurjeewana, ak geanali gideaba iihidu gajeewuurjeewana niny, aba gideaba gajeadaaha giduurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giliwas sih rar niny iissa ghoamiidu geaw gawuurji gidamiyda niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida wassean sina riing'eeda gwandeawa ramaseanda aba deaweeda; aba gideaba riing'eeda ramaseanda deaweeda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ghoanali gideaba niny ghwaan gageanda riing'eega, nea niny jeadaanyi ea manda riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida mida jeadaanyi ak gwasin riing'eeda; ak ea manda siida sina riing'eeda jea ea nidaah niny ghana ghwanal niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diibiga manang'i, adagwareenganeegwa sih; siida sina ng'asheega doobiiweadi gwandeawa doobiiwnata, gawuurji gidadoabiiwaata niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida sina riing'eeda gaba meang'nyeandeenda; aba gideaba meang'nyeandeenda ghayi gabean gwasina riing'eeda. Gissibaysiina wunooda Orjeeda ASEETA geataajiit ghwadatas gadiyeeda meang'nyeandeenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda siida jiilu ASEETA ak gwasina riing'eeda; aba gideaba seareeda ASEETA gwanda jeadaanyi, ak ea maygwasin riing'eeda aba gideaba gwajiilu ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nih abeeda gajeadaah gideaba diibiga ASEETA akeega gil, ak ea akeega gil diibiga meang'nyeandeenda, aba gideaba dea masina ng'asheega doobiiweadi maba ASEETA, ghana dea mwabwariinya orjeeda ghaamwat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba nih giijasta ghayi oobean ayiinya aba mwadi gil, gideaba abwariinya geat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea adoowuurjeewi Gayni ghayi was siida muy ak gwanuus orjeeda ghaamwat. Ak ghwasaan inyas gwanuus? Gweagu searoojigaaschi munyas nea orjeeda ghaamwat ea doabiiwaat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjoogiyya, adaghahameagwa ng'eanyi, aba gideaba ghwasteagwa ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aseasa geanali gideaba sisuuchi miyeeda ak geeweayi jeeda eaweega, aba gideaba geabwariinyi fuga siduupcheewi. Nea dea mandeawana bariinyeega goobiida jeeda miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giliwas sih nyooh ghwasit orjeeda ghaamwat abeeda gwanuusa buuneeda, ak agooga ghoanali gideaba siida nuusa buuneeda mandeawana eaweega manda muudeanooda aba jeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nih sinali bariinyeega, aba gideaba niny gabeagu eaweagaaschi aba badahuukaasa; asi gamiiseasa eara aseasa eebeakna eaweagaasa aba badahuuka orjooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida iimideawa haleanjeeda ng'eanyiida ak ghwadaah orjeeda ghaamwat nea gwanda gidagasa, ak ghaweada gida aba jeadaanyi, abeeda bariinyeega ASEETA gwandeataan jeadaanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diibiga manang'i, adeabwariinyi aba ng'asheanda ghana baloolda gagasa eabwariinya aba sinooda ea huumeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba nih gajeanala gideaba geebeayi huumeanda, ak geesikteawi aba jeesingaasa aba madeadaanyi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyargweakseasa gurooruunatkaasa; aba gideaba ASEETA ea haweewa gurooruunatkaasa, ak ghwanal haleanjeeda sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga aabwariinyi, iimeargweakseasa gurooruunatkaasa, abeeda geandeawi gidasirarji aba madeeda ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak iissa geenyaschi gidasimuschi, aba gideaba geang'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi nea geesinyi gidabwariiy niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea nih ea diigheandaanyi gil, gideaba ea mwasa gheawunga Baleandaanyi was Yesu Gristo nea geebariinyayi geat, gawuurji gidagoondaneasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buuneesean ang'waay diigheanyeekaaschi goobiita jeadaanyi, nea goobiida niny jeenyaawa. Aba sareani abeeda geanali gideaba goobiida jeedeanya, aba Guroorooda ghayi gooneasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
